---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Rape Cases | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="General information on allegations of rape under criminal law.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Rape Cases</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Allegations of rape are serious and are governed by the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita. This article provides general information only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
      <p>Investigations and trials follow special procedures. Medical and forensic evidence is commonly relevant.</p>
      <p>Anyone facing such allegations should seek professional legal advice promptly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-navy/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy mb-4">Related</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/practice" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Practice Areas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact the Firm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
